{'symbol': 'ADI', 'date': '2022-11-28 16:00:00', 'title': 'ANALOG DEVICES TO PARTICIPATE IN THE BARCLAYS GLOBAL TMT CONFERENCE', 'text': "WILMINGTON, MASS.--( BUSINESS WIRE )--ANALOG DEVICES, INC. (NASDAQ: ADI) TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT THE COMPANY'S EXECUTIVE VICE PRESIDENT, FINANCE AND CHIEF FINANCIAL OFFICER, PRASHANTH MAHENDRA-RAJAH, WILL SPEAK AT THE BARCLAYS GLOBAL TECHNOLOGY, MEDIA AND TELECOMMUNICATIONS CONFERENCE IN SAN FRANCISCO, CALIFORNIA ON WEDNESDAY, DECEMBER 7, 2022, AT 2:30 P.M. PACIFIC TIME."}